{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399100/extras/bcced6250daee23f57aaa0f73cd57fda.webp?t=1772367936\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The weapon lab has fallen.<br>Chaos reigns inside.<br>Retrieve the lost tech.<br>Infiltrate, survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399100/extras/ace07be1a2bb40ace9d770c433478c5a.poster.avif?t=1772367936\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399100/extras/ace07be1a2bb40ace9d770c433478c5a.webm?t=1772367936\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399100/extras/ace07be1a2bb40ace9d770c433478c5a.mp4?t=1772367936\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399100/extras/45898fb738d1ddb45a0af6219a872816.webp?t=1772367936\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid, fast-paced movement on pulsing synth beats turn combat into a violent ballet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stab, smash and shoot your enemies into oblivion.<br>Violence is not just encouraged, it's rewarded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay aggressive. Stay alive. Become unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399100/extras/a690ec405bf630cf01d35ba4f151207a.poster.avif?t=1772367936\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c